  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7201.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7201.02 Scope. These rules shall apply to local, county, and state law enforcement agencies that utilize automated license plate readers within the State of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #12648, eff 10-22-18",
